- Avoid storing sensitive information in browser storage.
- Do not cache protected patient responses in publicly accessible caches.
- Keep secrets in Cloudflare secrets or appropriate protected bindings.
- Implement session expiry and revocation.
- Define backups, recovery, retention, and deletion procedures.
- Avoid third-party analytics or services that receive identifiable patient information unless explicitly approved.
- Do not include real patient data in development fixtures or public repositories.

Treat applicable Malaysian personal data protection, healthcare confidentiality, facility security policies, and retention requirements as matters requiring verification before production deployment.

